## OLS推定値の計算式
**傾き$\beta_{1}$：**

$$
\hat{\beta_{1}}=\frac{\sum(X_i-\bar{X})(Y_i-\bar{Y})}{\sum(X_i-\bar{X})^2}
$$

**切片$\beta_{0}$：**

$$
\hat{\beta_{0}}=\bar{Y}-\hat{\beta_{1}}\bar{X}
$$

